{
  "headline": "Adenosine is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 5.9 days of 3 mg/mL 2 mL vials and Corvale General has 15.4 days",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show adenosine is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 99 vials of adenosine 3 mg/mL 2 mL at 16.9 vials per day, giving 5.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 235 vials of the same presentation at 15.2 vials per day, giving 15.4 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both sites' supply traces to Gland Pharma Limited (NDC 68083015610), a registered plant with VAI inspections through 2024-07-25.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E5", "E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked option is to transfer 21 vials of 3 mg/mL 2 mL from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to about 7 days while Corvale General retains roughly two weeks.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers Eugia US LLC and Fresenius Kabi USA, LLC are not on FDA's shortage list today, but their labels name no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D9", "D10"]
    }
  ]
}
